# Configure PostgreSQL through SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL, SPRING_DATASOURCE_USERNAME,
# SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD before starting the server.
# To create the first administrator on an empty database, set BIKE_ADMIN_LOGIN
# and BIKE_ADMIN_PASSWORD (12-128 characters). Remove these variables after setup.
# Set adminLogin and adminPassword in your private HTTP client environment.
# The HTTP client must retain the SESSION cookie between requests.
# For HTTPS deployments set SERVER_SERVLET_SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE=true.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 1

### Obtain CSRF token before login (also establishes an anonymous session).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf

> {%
    client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token);
%}

### Login. Passwords are sent only in request bodies.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "login": "{{adminLogin}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Login rotates the session identifier and clears CSRF: get a fresh token.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf

> {%
    client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token);
%}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me

### Available roles (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles

### List users (ADMIN); enabled and search are optional.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?page=0&size=20&enabled=true&search=ivan

### Create user (ADMIN). Set initialPassword in your private client environment.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "login": "ivan",
  "displayName": "Ivan",
  "password": "{{initialPassword}}",
  "roleCodes": ["ADMIN"],
  "enabled": true
}

### Get user (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}

### Update login and name (ADMIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "login": "ivan",
  "displayName": "Ivan Petrov"
}

### Replace roles (ADMIN). Revokes all target user sessions.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/roles
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "roleCodes": ["ADMIN"]
}

### Enable/disable user (ADMIN). Revokes all target user sessions.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/enabled
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "enabled": false
}

### Change own password; requires current password. Revokes own sessions.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "currentPassword": "{{adminPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### Reset user password (ADMIN). Revokes all target user sessions.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/password
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### Revoke target user's sessions (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/logout-all
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Revoke all own sessions; next request requires login.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/logout-all
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Logout current session. Obtain a new CSRF token before logging in again.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
